+When the filter ``type`` is ``report``, ``report_type`` and ``report_queue``
+should be set together.  When those are set, the filter match/unmatch if a
+report of the given ``report_type`` is in the given ``report_queue``.  It will
+ignore reports that generated before the last time the filter scanned the
+queue.  Based on the ``report_type``, more files may need to be set.
